{
  "id": "Lyo.HomeInventory.Models",
  "name": "Lyo.HomeInventory.Models",
  "area": "Plugins",
  "tagline": "Shared request/response DTOs, enums, and route constants for HomeInventory HTTP and Blazor clients.",
  "description": "Shared wire types for household inventory. `Request/` and `Response/` types are used by `Lyo.HomeInventory.Api` (`CreateBuilder` + stock/notes/tags routes) and `Lyo.HomeInventory.Web.Components`. Enums live here so the store contract (`Lyo.HomeInventory`) and HTTP surface share one vocabulary. This package has no DI registration.",
  "features": [
    "Enums for item status, condition, movement type, and attachment role.",
    "`HomeProductKeys` known identifier kinds and `HomeProductKeyEntry` (kind/value/note). The same kind may repeat.",
    "`Constants.Rest.HomeInventory` route prefixes.",
    "`HomeInventoryFilePaths` FileStorage PathPrefix helpers (`home-inventory/items/{id}`).",
    "`HomeInventoryEntityTypes` stable EntityRef type names for Note/Tag composition."
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Route constants",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "var items = Constants.Rest.HomeInventory.Items;\nvar prefix = HomeInventoryFilePaths.ForItem(itemId);"
    }
  ],
